{"material_id": "ntce.gaozhong.lishi.2018b.q28.material.recovered", "text": "下面是某讲师讲授“商和西周”这一内容时的实录片段：师：商朝后期，生活在渭水流域的周强大起来，并在牧野之战中击败商朝的军队主力。其后，商朝灭亡。请看《夏商周的疆域变迁示意图》。生：（观察地图）。师：比较两幅地图，最明显的不同点是什么？生：周朝版图大大超过了夏和商。师：很好，版图变化反映了早期国家的发展。如果你是周武王，需要解决什么问题？生：如何持久、有效地统治这些地方。师：是啊，新兴的周王朝如何治理呢？学完本课的重点分封制和宗法制，也许大家就有答案了。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2018年下半年教师资格证考试《高中历史》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "9942f3b4b3f5dee5a597eed868e9c8953550778b24805a70242d55caed6ec988", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2943, "decoded_csv_character_end": 3170, "next_source_question_number": 30, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2018年下半年教师资格证考试《高中历史》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 28, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "9942f3b4b3f5dee5a597eed868e9c8953550778b24805a70242d55caed6ec988"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.lishi.2018b.q28"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.lishi.s1.k01", "ntce.gaozhong.lishi.s1.k09", "ntce.gaozhong.lishi.s1.k10"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.ability.subject"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.410.r001"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.gaozhong.lishi.2018b.q28"], "word_count": 227, "level": "gaozhong", "subject": "lishi", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/高中真题/2018年下半年教师资格证考试《高中历史》题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2018年下半年教师资格证考试《高中历史》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "9942f3b4b3f5dee5a597eed868e9c8953550778b24805a70242d55caed6ec988", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2943, "decoded_csv_character_end": 3170, "next_source_question_number": 30, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2018年下半年教师资格证考试《高中历史》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 28, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "9942f3b4b3